# Security Boundaries
- Passwords must be hashed using bcrypt with work factor >= 10.
- Secrets must never be committed or logged.
- Sanitize and whitelist all inputs via DTOs and Zod schemas.
- Payment webhooks must be authenticated via cryptographic signatures before modifying transaction or subscription tables.
- Protect active exam attempt payloads against question explanation and answer key leakage.
